            Landing Page Development
          </a>

          <a
            href="/services/ecommerce-development"
            class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-[11px] text-[#555] transition-colors hover:bg-white hover:text-[#111]"
          >
            E-Commerce Development
          </a>

          <a
            href="/services/nextjs-development"
            class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-[11px] text-[#555] transition-colors hover:bg-white hover:text-[#111]"
          >
            Next.js Development
